; the entry a Glamorous Toolkit session loads: the compiler, the session layer
; and the views over both.
;
;   (CarpProject onRoot: '<this repository>' entry: 'gt.carp') asBrowserTool
;
; the session host provides the shared carp-views runtime before it loads the
; project.

(load "carp-session/carp-session.carp")
(load "views/compiler.carp")
(load "views/session.carp")
